    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Phoenix Nirvana Rebirth</i>, you step into the shoes of Su Wan, a woman broken by tragedy. Once a wealthy heiress, she is now blind and alone after her family\u2019s collapse. An unexpected pregnancy draws her into the mysterious Bo family, a mansion steeped in secrets. Guide Su Wan as she rises from the ashes, uncovers the dark truths of the Bo estate, and embarks on a gripping journey of revenge, redemption, and rebirth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel Experience</strong>: Immerse yourself in a stunningly illustrated world with vibrant character art that brings Su Wan\u2019s story to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative</strong>: Every choice you make shapes Su Wan\u2019s path, unlocking a variety of story branches and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Interactions</strong>: Connect with intricate characters like Bo Jingxing, Feng Yichen, and Ning Yan to uncover hidden layers of the narrative.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Storyline</strong>: Start with Su Wan\u2019s tragic fall and unravel the Bo family\u2019s web of power struggles and buried conspiracies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Your decisions determine Su Wan\u2019s fate\u2014will she soar as a phoenix or succumb to despair?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Evolution</strong>: Witness Su Wan\u2019s transformation from a fragile victim to a resolute survivor seeking justice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Visuals &amp; Sound</strong>: High-quality artwork and atmospheric audio deliver a thrilling, unforgettable experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Choose This Game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Phoenix Nirvana Rebirth</i> is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s an emotional odyssey. Feel Su Wan\u2019s anguish, stand by her through hardship, and guide her in a world of adversity. With rich character dynamics, pulse-pounding plot twists, and the power to forge her destiny, this journey will captivate you from beginning to end. Join Su Wan today and witness her rebirth from the flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: This game is the first chapter of the novel, and the first chapter ends at the scene where Su Wan mistakenly thinks Bo Jingxing is a cowherd in the club and secretly votes for him with a wool flower, and Bo Jingxing feels insulted and starts to take his anger out on the club owner.)</p>",
